WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.300
Every app says your records are secured.

2
00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:05.720
Almost none of them tell you what that actually means.

3
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.090
So here is exactly what happens,

4
00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:11.900
step by step, when this one says it.

5
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:18.680
The certificate gets a fingerprint. A SHA-256 hash.

6
00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:25.119
That hash goes to OpenTimestamps. Two independent calendars witness

7
00:00:25.119 --> 00:00:25.480
it.

8
00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:31.080
The next Bitcoin block absorbs it. About an hour.

9
00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:34.448
After that, the proof stands on its own. You

10
00:00:34.448 --> 00:00:36.562
don't need us to vouch for it.

